OL,3,GNEWSAAnger over plan to divert arts
OL,4,Acash to reopen tip
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtists and creative workers are urging
OL,7,FBradford Council's leadership to
OL,8,Frethink plans to scrap #400,000 of
OL,9,Ffunding previously earmarked for
OL,10,Fcultural events.
OL,12,FThe money had been approved for
OL,13,Factivities including festivals,
OL,14,Fheritage projects and live music, as
OL,15,Fwell as support for local community
OL,16,Fcultural organisations.
OL,18,FBut it is now set to be used to reopen
OL,19,FSugden End Household Waste Recycling
OL,20,FCentre and restore bank-holiday opening
OL,21,Fat tips across the district.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
