OL,3,GNEWSAAnger over plan to divert arts
OL,4,Acash to reopen tip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has insisted the decision
OL,7,F"does not affect current cultural
OL,8,Finvestment commitments", but artists
OL,9,Fhave branded the decision - taken just
OL,10,Fmonths after Bradford's year as UK City
OL,11,Fof Culture ended - is "short-sighted".
